The  driver provides support for STMicrolelectronics’ M25P family
of SPI connected NOR flash devices.  The machine‐independent dri‐
ver was written by for the  Champaign‐Urbana  Community  Wireless
Network Project (CUWiN), and appeared in Some important bits that
are  vital  for  use  as a mass storage device are still missing.
Specifically, there is no API to erase the device, and  there  is
no support for device partitioning.
